  "description": "High-performance generic list comparator for .NET. Compares two arbitrary lists of objects in a single parallel pass and returns structured, grid-bindable diff data (only-in-reference, only-in-target, and in-both-but-differing rows) instead of a pass/fail verdict. Built for non-regression testing and large-scale data reconciliation.",
